      "html": "<body>\r\n<cb:mulu level=\"1\" n=\"16\" type=\"會\">16 菩薩見實會</cb:mulu><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"6\" type=\"品\">6 龍女授記品</cb:mulu><cb:div type=\"hui\">\r\n<milestone n=\"64\" unit=\"juan\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b13\">0367b13</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b14\">0367b14</span><cb:div type=\"pin\">\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b15\">0367b15</span><cb:juan n=\"064\" fun=\"open\"><cb:mulu n=\"064\" type=\"卷\"></cb:mulu><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷<anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0367b01\"/>第六十四</cb:jhead></cb:juan>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b16\">0367b16</span>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b17\">0367b17</span><byline cb:type=\"Translator\"><anchor xml:id=\"fxT11p0367b02\"/>北齊三藏那連提耶舍譯</byline>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b18\">0367b18</span><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"7\" type=\"品\">7 龍王授記品</cb:mulu><head><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367010\">〔菩薩〕－【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367010\">菩薩【大】，〔－〕【宮】</span><app n=\"0367010\"><p class=\"lg\">菩薩</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\"><space quantity=\"0\"/></rdg></app>見實會第十六之四龍王授記品\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b19\">0367b19</span>第七</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b20\">0367b20</span><p>爾時難陀優波難陀龍王等九億諸龍，見諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b21\">0367b21</span>龍女設妙供養，及聞龍女得授記已，生希有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b22\">0367b22</span>心未曾有心，作是思惟：「乃至如來、世尊、應、正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b23\">0367b23</span>遍知希有未有，以是如來知諸眾生機根深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b24\">0367b24</span>信如來，無有少分不見不聞不證如來正法，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b25\">0367b25</span>是其善說能令大眾聞已現知無有時節，隨\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b26\">0367b26</span>機授法必令得果，令諸智者現得證知。乃至\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b27\">0367b27</span>女人動轉輕躁智慧淺短，猶得解佛所說深\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b28\">0367b28</span>法，況餘智者善能安住如來法中諸弟子眾。」\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367b29\">0367b29</span>如諸女人欲心增上、瞋心增上、癡心增上，猶\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c01\">0367c01</span>能得知如來所說。是故難陀、優波難陀龍王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c02\">0367c02</span>及諸龍等，於如來所生希有心生未有心，為\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c03\">0367c03</span>供養故，遍閻浮提諸山大海興雲遍覆一切\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c04\">0367c04</span>世間，普雨香水以成香泥。彼香泥氣充滿三\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c05\">0367c05</span>千大千佛剎，其中眾生聞香氣者，皆不退於\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c06\">0367c06</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提。於迦毘羅城縱廣正\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c07\">0367c07</span>等六十由旬，雨赤真珠遍覆其地，復以無\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c08\">0367c08</span>價種種眾寶周匝遍覆尼拘陀園。復以龍華\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c09\">0367c09</span>化成妙堂，縱廣正等六十由旬，椽柱梁壁皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c10\">0367c10</span>用七寶。復更化作無量樂器，為供養故擊出\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c11\">0367c11</span>妙音。於彼龍花微妙堂中，化作九億種種雜\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c12\">0367c12</span>色眾花<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367011\">旒＝流【明】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367011\">旒【大】下同，流【明】下同</span><app n=\"0367011\"><p class=\"lg\">旒</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">流</rdg></app>蘇懸於堂上，以毘琉璃網覆諸寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c13\">0367c13</span>柱，以無價寶遍布堂下。其寶柔軟，譬如三十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c14\">0367c14</span>三天般籌緘婆羅石，其石之色如毘琉璃，石\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c15\">0367c15</span>觸柔軟如迦遮隣提迦衣，微妙可樂<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367012\">繫＝擊【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367012\">繫【大】，擊【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0367012\"><p class=\"lg\">繫</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">擊</rdg></app>人眼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c16\">0367c16</span>目，令諸天人愛戀繫念。彼諸寶等亦復如是。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c17\">0367c17</span>彼諸種種摩尼寶中，或有出於涼冷光焰，有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c18\">0367c18</span>出青水、有出赤水、有出白水、有出黃水，或復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c19\">0367c19</span>有出雜色之水，或復有出涼樂之風。或有寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c20\">0367c20</span>珠隨諸眾生所須之事皆悉出之，或復有寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c21\">0367c21</span>出於<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367013\">腴＝油【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367013\">腴【大】，油【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0367013\"><p class=\"lg\">腴</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">油</rdg></app>澤，或有摩尼堪為明鏡，一切大眾皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c22\">0367c22</span>現其中，於迦毘羅大城之中所出人民，隨其\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c23\">0367c23</span>多少皆現寶中。一切大眾皆悉覩見佛及聲\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c24\">0367c24</span>聞。作此種種神通變化，以彼摩尼寶神力故，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c25\">0367c25</span>於其地中出於種種雜色寶蓋，及以種種雜\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c26\">0367c26</span>色寶幢，亦有種種雜色寶幡。復出種種雜花\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c27\">0367c27</span>旒蘇，亦有種種雜香旒蘇，復有種種雜寶旒\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c28\">0367c28</span>蘇，復出種種真珠旒蘇。復出種種雜色<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367014\">龍＝雜【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0367014\">龍【大】，雜【宮】</span><app n=\"0367014\"><p class=\"lg\">龍</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">雜</rdg></app>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0367c29\">0367c29</span>幡，復出種種眾寶鈴網。復出種種雜色良馬，\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a01\">0368a01</span>諸所出者皆是龍力。</p><p>爾時難陀、優波難陀龍\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a02\">0368a02</span>王及九億龍，驅彼良馬隨而步行右遶三匝，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a03\">0368a03</span>以妙迦遮隣提迦柔軟之寶而散世尊。於彼\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a04\">0368a04</span>堂下地中所出種種眾寶上昇虛空，雨於如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a05\">0368a05</span>來及聲聞上。復以諸龍無量樂器，於虛空中\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a06\">0368a06</span>自然出好微妙音聲，供養於佛。爾時九億諸\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a07\">0368a07</span>龍遶佛三匝已，在於佛前合掌默然念佛功\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a08\">0368a08</span>德，瞻仰如來目不暫捨。樂佛功德，深心安住\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a09\">0368a09</span>阿耨多羅三藐三菩提故。彼等少時合掌默\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a10\">0368a10</span>然念佛功德已，偏袒右肩，右膝著地合掌向\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a11\">0368a11</span>佛，五體投地為佛作禮，眾共一音以偈讚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a12\">0368a12</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a13\">0368a13</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「久修威儀百福相，<caesura/>悲心離垢行具足，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a14\">0368a14</span><p class=\"lg\">棄捨無盡眾寶地，<caesura/>世尊出於迦毘城。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a15\">0368a15</span><p class=\"lg\">於六年中修苦行，<caesura/>如來不得甘露道，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a16\">0368a16</span><p class=\"lg\">善逝意猶不退悶，<caesura/>以其久修智慧故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a17\">0368a17</span><p class=\"lg\">如來真是天人師，<caesura/>為世間故修苦行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a18\">0368a18</span><p class=\"lg\">世人聞已尚不堪，<caesura/>況復能以目親覩。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a19\">0368a19</span><p class=\"lg\">牟尼過去捨頭目，<caesura/>如聖所集菩提心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a20\">0368a20</span><p class=\"lg\">我等聞是不生樂，<caesura/>由聞如來苦行故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a21\">0368a21</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛本作忍辱仙，<caesura/>為迦利王截手足，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a22\">0368a22</span><p class=\"lg\">及劓耳鼻不生恚，<caesura/>我等聞是不能忍。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a23\">0368a23</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛以身上<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368001\">秤＝稱【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368001\">秤【大】，稱【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0368001\"><p class=\"lg\">秤</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">稱</rdg></app><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368002\">盤＝槃【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368002\">盤【大】，槃【明】</span><app n=\"0368002\"><p class=\"lg\">盤</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">槃</rdg></app>，<caesura/>為鳥歸投不捨棄，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a24\">0368a24</span><p class=\"lg\">我等聞已亦不樂，<caesura/>如來過去甚勤苦。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a25\">0368a25</span><p class=\"lg\">何故我等心不樂？<caesura/>以世尊行極苦故，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a26\">0368a26</span><p class=\"lg\">於如來所作惡者，<caesura/>墮惡道時佛復悲。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a27\">0368a27</span><p class=\"lg\">具足聖慧大導師，<caesura/>云何能行不害心？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a28\">0368a28</span><p class=\"lg\">修習道行無瘡疣，<caesura/>唯願佛說安樂行。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368a29\">0368a29</span><p class=\"lg\">今此龍眾已發心，<caesura/>求於善逝菩提行，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b01\">0368b01</span><p class=\"lg\">如佛所說悉能行，<caesura/>唯願速說菩提道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b02\">0368b02</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸龍眾甚渴仰，<caesura/>唯求不死不生處，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b03\">0368b03</span><p class=\"lg\">願說如來安隱行，<caesura/>令此眾生易受化。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b04\">0368b04</span><p>爾時世尊見諸龍眾設其供養及聞發願，知\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b05\">0368b05</span>深信已，佛於爾時現微笑相。諸佛法爾，若現\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b06\">0368b06</span>微笑，即於面門放種種色無量光明，其光遍\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b07\">0368b07</span>照上至梵天，照已還來從佛頂入。爾時慧命\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b08\">0368b08</span>馬勝比丘以偈問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b09\">0368b09</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善哉沙門大牟尼，<caesura/>非是無因現微笑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b10\">0368b10</span><p class=\"lg\">慈悲導師唯願說，<caesura/>無等善慧笑因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b11\">0368b11</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾瞻仰求欲聞，<caesura/>世尊無量功德行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b12\">0368b12</span><p class=\"lg\">於笑生疑心不樂，<caesura/>唯願法王斷眾疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b13\">0368b13</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於釋迦佛法中，<caesura/>今生敬信心欣喜？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b14\">0368b14</span><p class=\"lg\">誰令今日魔波旬，<caesura/>心意迷亂不欣樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b15\">0368b15</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於今日能恭事，<caesura/>功德法父大導師？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b16\">0368b16</span><p class=\"lg\">誰作第一勝供養？<caesura/>願釋師子上上說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b17\">0368b17</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸大眾合指掌，<caesura/>皆悉對佛瞻仰住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b18\">0368b18</span><p class=\"lg\"><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368003\">唯＝惟【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368003\">唯【大】，惟【明】</span><app n=\"0368003\"><p class=\"lg\">唯</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【明】\">惟</rdg></app>願<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368004\">導＝眾【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368004\">導【大】，眾【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0368004\"><p class=\"lg\">導</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">眾</rdg></app>師除疑網，<caesura/>為眾演說笑因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b19\">0368b19</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾聞已生欣喜，<caesura/>能知世尊正法教，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b20\">0368b20</span><p class=\"lg\">大智世尊令眾喜，<caesura/>隨順正教善安住。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b21\">0368b21</span><p>爾時世尊以偈答慧命馬勝曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b22\">0368b22</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「深廣智慧大眾師，<caesura/>說時梵音具八種，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b23\">0368b23</span><p class=\"lg\">清淨其心離穢濁，<caesura/>諦聽我說笑因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b24\">0368b24</span><p class=\"lg\">此諸龍王敬信心，<caesura/>於我設供超一切，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b25\">0368b25</span><p class=\"lg\">是等為求佛菩提，<caesura/>利益一切世間故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b26\">0368b26</span><p class=\"lg\">悲心增上觀眾生，<caesura/>無有導師云何樂？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b27\">0368b27</span><p class=\"lg\">我云何得大菩提，<caesura/>成熟眾生不疲勞？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b28\">0368b28</span><p class=\"lg\">深樂寂定具智慧，<caesura/>乘安樂乘心清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368b29\">0368b29</span><p class=\"lg\">於空無相及無願，<caesura/>無量劫來久已修。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c01\">0368c01</span><p class=\"lg\">其心平等觀世間，<caesura/>如佛所得智慧相，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c02\">0368c02</span><p class=\"lg\">慈悲喜心皆平等，<caesura/>為令世間安隱故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c03\">0368c03</span><p class=\"lg\">第一悲心憐愍者，<caesura/>當得作佛稱其意，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c04\">0368c04</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等觀察世間已，<caesura/>當成導師號無怨。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c05\">0368c05</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等當得甘露時，<caesura/>無有魔怨亦無餘，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c06\">0368c06</span><p class=\"lg\">恒常<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368005\">演＝復【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368005\">演【大】，復【宮】</span><app n=\"0368005\"><p class=\"lg\">演</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">復</rdg></app>說無我法，<caesura/>一向無有世俗說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c07\">0368c07</span><p class=\"lg\">彼諸如來具大悲，<caesura/>令諸眾生入佛智，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c08\">0368c08</span><p class=\"lg\">是諸善逝說法時，<caesura/>一切眾生皆信解。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c09\">0368c09</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等世世修道時，<caesura/>成熟眾生不為難，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c10\">0368c10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼所成熟聞法已，<caesura/>當得解脫證甘露。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c11\">0368c11</span><p class=\"lg\">諸聞法者悉解脫，<caesura/>是諸眾生皆端嚴，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c12\">0368c12</span><p class=\"lg\">一切眾生皆能知，<caesura/>彼諸如來所說法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c13\">0368c13</span><p class=\"lg\">一切鬼神及畜生，<caesura/>無有不解彼佛語，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c14\">0368c14</span><p class=\"lg\">一切皆得念法已，<caesura/>能解如來甘露法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c15\">0368c15</span><p class=\"lg\">無有眾生聞佛說，<caesura/>當時不生愛樂心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c16\">0368c16</span><p class=\"lg\">愛樂彼佛所說者，<caesura/>一切皆悉得甘露。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c17\">0368c17</span><p class=\"lg\">彼時所有受化者，<caesura/>當得解脫生老病，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c18\">0368c18</span><p class=\"lg\">及解脫死憂悲苦，<caesura/>聞佛說已心無垢。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c19\">0368c19</span><p class=\"lg\">如是釋迦牟尼佛，<caesura/>說諸龍意答佛子，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c20\">0368c20</span><p class=\"lg\">如彼堅智心中轉，<caesura/>為得無等菩提故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c21\">0368c21</span><p class=\"lg\">如來授彼諸龍記，<caesura/>大眾聞已皆欣喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c22\">0368c22</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾喜已歸依佛，<caesura/>一切皆悉心寂靜。</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c23\">0368c23</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"8\" type=\"品\">8 鳩槃茶授記品</cb:mulu><head>鳩槃<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368006\">茶＝荼【宋】【宮】【聖】【聖乙】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368006\">茶【大】下同，荼【宋】【宮】【聖】【聖乙】下同</span><app n=\"0368006\"><p class=\"lg\">茶</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【宮】 【聖】 【聖乙】\">荼</rdg></app>授記品第八</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c24\">0368c24</span><p>爾時復有諸鳩槃茶一億八千萬，見諸阿修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c25\">0368c25</span>羅、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368007\">伽＝迦【三】【宮】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0368007\">伽【大】，迦【宋】【元】【明】【宮】</span><app n=\"0368007\"><p class=\"lg\">伽</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">迦</rdg></app>樓羅、龍女、龍王等，供養如來聞授記已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c26\">0368c26</span>稱其心意踊躍欣喜，生希有心得未曾有：「如\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c27\">0368c27</span>來世尊功德智慧微妙殊勝，得如是等希有\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c28\">0368c28</span>供養不怪不喜，以佛智慧於諸智慧最尊勝\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0368c29\">0368c29</span>故。譬如大海不增不減。何以故？以深廣故。\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a01\">0369a01</span>如是世尊得勝供養心無增減，亦復如是。何\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a02\">0369a02</span>以故？於一切法無所疑故。」爾時一億八千萬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a03\">0369a03</span>鳩槃茶等為供養故，化作一億八千萬蓋，皆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a04\">0369a04</span>是七寶之所成就，金線寶蓋、銀線寶蓋、毘琉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a05\">0369a05</span>璃線眾寶之蓋、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369001\">頗梨＝玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/>【宮】下同</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369001\">頗梨【大】下同，玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/>【宮】下同</span><app n=\"0369001\"><p class=\"lg\">頗梨</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宮】\">玻<g ref=\"#CB00224\"/></rdg></app>珠線眾寶之蓋、赤真珠\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a06\">0369a06</span>線眾寶之蓋、<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369002\">馬瑙＝碼碯【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369002\">馬瑙【大】，碼碯【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0369002\"><p class=\"lg\">馬瑙</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖乙】\">碼碯</rdg></app>珠線眾寶之蓋、車<g ref=\"#CB00006\"/>珠線\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a07\">0369a07</span>眾寶之蓋。彼諸鳩槃茶於眾寶蓋懸寶旒蘇，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a08\">0369a08</span>有種種色，金線寶蓋銀線旒蘇，銀線寶蓋金\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a09\">0369a09</span>線旒蘇，毘琉璃蓋頗梨旒蘇，頗梨寶蓋毘琉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a10\">0369a10</span>璃線以為旒蘇，赤真珠蓋車<g ref=\"#CB00006\"/>旒蘇，車<g ref=\"#CB00006\"/>寶\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a11\">0369a11</span>蓋赤真珠線以為旒蘇，馬瑙寶蓋頗梨旒蘇。\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a12\">0369a12</span>又復化作一億八千萬眾寶之車，亦種種色\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a13\">0369a13</span>甚奇微妙，所謂金、銀、琉璃、頗梨、真珠、車<g ref=\"#CB00006\"/>、馬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a14\">0369a14</span>瑙。於其車上復更化作一億八千萬眾寶之\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a15\">0369a15</span>蓋與車相連，一一寶蓋皆有百子，其諸蓋莖\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a16\">0369a16</span>皆用金銀及以頗梨毘琉璃等。於彼寶蓋復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a17\">0369a17</span>化種種寶花旒蘇嚴飾其蓋，所謂金花旒蘇、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a18\">0369a18</span>銀花旒蘇、毘琉璃花以為旒蘇、頗梨旒蘇、赤\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a19\">0369a19</span>寶旒蘇、龍珠旒蘇、赤真珠花以為旒蘇，復以\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a20\">0369a20</span>赤真珠網彌覆其上。又復化作鳩槃茶樂，出\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a21\">0369a21</span>種種聲而用樂佛。復更化作一億八千萬眾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a22\">0369a22</span>寶色馬，調伏駿疾以駕其車。</p><p>爾時鳩槃茶等\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a23\">0369a23</span>各乘寶車遶佛三匝，以七寶花而散佛上。爾\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a24\">0369a24</span>時彼諸鳩槃茶等從車而下來至佛前，頭面\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a25\">0369a25</span>禮已，復遶三匝，曲躬合掌住立一面，以偈讚\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a26\">0369a26</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a27\">0369a27</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「不增不減大牟尼，<caesura/>譬如須彌諸山王，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a28\">0369a28</span><p class=\"lg\">受此無上供養者，<caesura/>如來以得無畏故。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369a29\">0369a29</span><p class=\"lg\">觀諸眾生但有名，<caesura/>及但有用不取著，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b01\">0369b01</span><p class=\"lg\">導師以修寂滅定，<caesura/>是故智者無貢高。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b02\">0369b02</span><p class=\"lg\">牟尼知世猶如幻，<caesura/>亦如夢中受欲樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b03\">0369b03</span><p class=\"lg\">復似水月春時焰，<caesura/>如是觀察悉無餘。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b04\">0369b04</span><p class=\"lg\">譬如乾城無有實，<caesura/>於十方求不可得，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b05\">0369b05</span><p class=\"lg\">其城無實但有名，<caesura/>佛見世法悉如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b06\">0369b06</span><p class=\"lg\">一切人天所供養，<caesura/>寶車寶蓋及音樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b07\">0369b07</span><p class=\"lg\">幢花旒蘇合掌等，<caesura/>世尊觀知如影響。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b08\">0369b08</span><p class=\"lg\">我等設是供養已，<caesura/>願我當來得作佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b09\">0369b09</span><p class=\"lg\">亦願我知世如夢，<caesura/>知已說法如世尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b10\">0369b10</span><p class=\"lg\">我等見諸苦惱者，<caesura/>生老病死之所逼，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b11\">0369b11</span><p class=\"lg\">願知無<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369003\">死＝比【元】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369003\">死【大】，比【元】【明】</span><app n=\"0369003\"><p class=\"lg\">死</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【元】 【明】\">比</rdg></app>佛菩提，<caesura/>說令聞者得解脫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b12\">0369b12</span><p class=\"lg\">於諸無智眾生所，<caesura/>願得菩提為說法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b13\">0369b13</span><p class=\"lg\">演說無有垢濁法，<caesura/>無<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369004\">道＝導【三】【宮】＊</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369004\">道【大】＊，導【宋】【元】【明】【宮】＊</span><app n=\"0369004\"><p class=\"lg\">道</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">導</rdg></app>眾中為作<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369005\">導＝道【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369005\">導【大】，道【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0369005\"><p class=\"lg\">導</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">道</rdg></app>。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b14\">0369b14</span><p>爾時世尊知諸鳩槃茶等深生信已，現微笑\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b15\">0369b15</span>相。爾時慧命馬勝比丘以偈問曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b16\">0369b16</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「佛非無因現微笑，<caesura/>不怪一切為希有，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b17\">0369b17</span><p class=\"lg\">如來不怪而現笑，<caesura/>我今願聞此因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b18\">0369b18</span><p class=\"lg\">一切天人皆有疑，<caesura/>見佛口中現微笑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b19\">0369b19</span><p class=\"lg\">唯願斷除諸疑網，<caesura/>演說世尊微笑事。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b20\">0369b20</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於正法得深信？<caesura/>誰能如法見慈父？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b21\">0369b21</span><p class=\"lg\">誰佛所讚行供養？<caesura/>人中勝者我願聞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b22\">0369b22</span><p class=\"lg\">今日誰於有為行，<caesura/>見其過患能棄捨？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b23\">0369b23</span><p class=\"lg\">今日誰能住實際？<caesura/>清淨心者我願聞。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b24\">0369b24</span><p class=\"lg\">誰能降魔及眷屬？<caesura/>誰能令佛心欣喜？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b25\">0369b25</span><p class=\"lg\">誰能得深有為底？<caesura/>我願得聞斷疑心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b26\">0369b26</span><p class=\"lg\">一切大眾合掌住，<caesura/>為聞如來笑因緣，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b27\">0369b27</span><p class=\"lg\">願斷一切眾生疑，<caesura/>兩足尊者說彼記。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b28\">0369b28</span><p>爾時世尊以偈答慧命馬勝言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369b29\">0369b29</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「善哉馬勝問是義，<caesura/>汝於世間大利益。</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c01\">0369c01</span><p class=\"lg\">以汝問笑因緣故，<caesura/>諦聽馬勝我今說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c02\">0369c02</span><p class=\"lg\">鳩槃茶眾供養我，<caesura/>於寂滅法心<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369006\">得＝信【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0369006\">得【大】，信【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0369006\"><p class=\"lg\">得</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">信</rdg></app>住，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c03\">0369c03</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等見我不驚怪，<caesura/>心生希有起願求。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c04\">0369c04</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等今日供養我，<caesura/>其心簡擇寂滅法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c05\">0369c05</span><p class=\"lg\">以深心信起大悲，<caesura/>於失道者能作<app type=\"star\" corresp=\"#0369004\"><p class=\"lg\">道</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】\">導</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c06\">0369c06</span><p class=\"lg\">愍眾生故供養我，<caesura/>為失道者起慈心，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c07\">0369c07</span><p class=\"lg\">此等賢智作是已，<caesura/>得捨鬼身生忉利。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c08\">0369c08</span><p class=\"lg\">天主恒以慈悲心，<caesura/>在天數數教導彼，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c09\">0369c09</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於諸法得無疑，<caesura/>得為帝釋親眷屬。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c10\">0369c10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於無量恒沙劫，<caesura/>一一國土行佛行，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c11\">0369c11</span><p class=\"lg\">被大弘誓堅固鎧，<caesura/>供養具大正法者。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c12\">0369c12</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於無量諸國土，<caesura/>心無疲倦令清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c13\">0369c13</span><p class=\"lg\">利益大眾作導師，<caesura/>當得作佛號不怪。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c14\">0369c14</span><p class=\"lg\">彼於諸國行行時，<caesura/>是國人必知成佛，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c15\">0369c15</span><p class=\"lg\">以此方便未來世，<caesura/>雖度眾生無怪心。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c16\">0369c16</span><p class=\"lg\">為求無上安隱道，<caesura/>淨諸國土都不怪，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c17\">0369c17</span><p class=\"lg\">於所作事心無著，<caesura/>於大菩提亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c18\">0369c18</span><p class=\"lg\">所問笑因我已答，<caesura/>眾生疑心皆得斷，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c19\">0369c19</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾離疑得欣喜，<caesura/>以定得知彼供養。」</p></lg></cb:div>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c20\">0369c20</span><cb:div type=\"pin\"><cb:mulu level=\"2\" n=\"9\" type=\"品\">9 乾闥婆授記品</cb:mulu><head>乾闥婆授記品第九</head>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c21\">0369c21</span><p>爾時復有三億六千萬乾闥婆眾，見諸阿修\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c22\">0369c22</span>羅、迦樓羅、龍女、龍王、鳩槃茶等，供養世尊聞\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c23\">0369c23</span>受記已，稱其心意欣喜踊悅，生希有心得未\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c24\">0369c24</span>曾有，歎言：「希有未曾有事。乃至如來所說法\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c25\">0369c25</span>界無有變異而示有作善根增長，雖無作者\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c26\">0369c26</span>而示作業。」彼乾闥婆等於此法中如是知已，\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c27\">0369c27</span>於如來所心生尊重，發阿耨多羅三藐三菩\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c28\">0369c28</span>提心。彼欣喜已為供佛故，化作三億六千萬\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0369c29\">0369c29</span>頭<g ref=\"#CB07568\"/>羅婆那大龍象王，皆有六牙。一一牙上\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a01\">0370a01</span>化作七池，一一池中化七蓮花，一一蓮花化\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a02\">0370a02</span>作千葉，一一葉上化七玉女，一一葉間化\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a03\">0370a03</span>七侍女，以天諸寶為莊嚴具而用莊飾，復\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a04\">0370a04</span>執天香而用供養。復於一一<g ref=\"#CB07568\"/>羅婆那象王\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a05\">0370a05</span>頭上化作三億六千萬蓋，七寶旒蘇懸蓋四\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a06\">0370a06</span>邊，七寶羅網以覆蓋上。復於一一<g ref=\"#CB07568\"/>羅婆那\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a07\">0370a07</span>象王頭上化作三億六千萬帳，皆是諸天妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a08\">0370a08</span>香所成，繒綵旒蘇懸帳四邊。化作三億六千\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a09\">0370a09</span>萬頭<g ref=\"#CB07568\"/>羅婆那大象王已，彼乾闥婆等各乘\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a10\">0370a10</span>其象鼓天音樂，於虛空中旋遶如來三十六\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a11\">0370a11</span>匝，以天旃檀末、天沈水末、天多摩羅葉末、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a12\">0370a12</span>天真金末、曼陀羅花、摩訶曼陀羅花、曼殊沙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a13\">0370a13</span>花、摩訶曼殊沙花、波樓沙花、摩訶波樓沙花、\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a14\">0370a14</span>迦迦羅婆花、摩訶迦迦羅婆花，又復化作七\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a15\">0370a15</span>寶之花而散佛上。彼乾闥婆等散香花時，是\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a16\">0370a16</span>香花氣逆風順風縱橫皆去。復雨種種天妙\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a17\">0370a17</span>香水，雨香水時於迦毘羅城縱廣正等六十\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a18\">0370a18</span>由旬皆成香泥。其香泥氣，充滿三千大千世\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a19\">0370a19</span>界，其中眾生聞香氣者，皆悉不退阿耨多羅\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a20\">0370a20</span>三藐三菩提。奏音樂時，其諸音聲遍滿三千\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a21\">0370a21</span>大千世界，其中眾生聞此聲者亦得不退阿\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a22\">0370a22</span>耨多羅三藐三菩提。如是一一諸乾闥婆，各\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a23\">0370a23</span>於三億六千萬象王頭上設其供養，令諸玉\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a24\">0370a24</span>女有作樂者、有作歌者、有作舞者。彼諸玉女\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a25\">0370a25</span>作歌舞時，令諸大眾一心觀望。復有玉女動\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a26\">0370a26</span>身手者、散旃檀末者、散沈水末者，廣作供養\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a27\">0370a27</span>如阿修羅所設之事等無異也。</p><p>爾時乾闥婆\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a28\">0370a28</span>等各乘<g ref=\"#CB07568\"/>羅婆那大象王頭，於虛空中遶佛\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370a29\">0370a29</span>三十六匝已，各從象下復遶三匝，頭面禮佛\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b01\">0370b01</span>曲躬合掌，在一面住，以偈讚曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b02\">0370b02</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「世尊勝慧出有頂，<caesura/>自既出已復度他，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b03\">0370b03</span><p class=\"lg\">一切世間無如佛，<caesura/>相好光顏極端正。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b04\">0370b04</span><p class=\"lg\">人中最妙無邊稱，<caesura/>示現世間不思議，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b05\">0370b05</span><p class=\"lg\">不見一法性相異，<caesura/>而令眾生住於善。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b06\">0370b06</span><p class=\"lg\">無有變異真如法，<caesura/>但有言說無餘義，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b07\">0370b07</span><p class=\"lg\">無有用事及用者，<caesura/>雖然佛化諸群生。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b08\">0370b08</span><p class=\"lg\">不來不去亦不生，<caesura/>佛能演說如是法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b09\">0370b09</span><p class=\"lg\">雖說諸法體性空，<caesura/>世雄而令修習道。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b10\">0370b10</span><p class=\"lg\">無有一法能自作，<caesura/>世間明者說有作，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b11\">0370b11</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法各各不覺知，<caesura/>世尊示現一切作。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b12\">0370b12</span><p class=\"lg\">如車多集眾分支，<caesura/>彼支不知自能作，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b13\">0370b13</span><p class=\"lg\">其車功用現可見，<caesura/>佛說諸法亦如是。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b14\">0370b14</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法各各不相教，<caesura/>亦不迭互相覺寤，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b15\">0370b15</span><p class=\"lg\">一切亦復不相依，<caesura/>法本不生亦不死。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b16\">0370b16</span><p class=\"lg\">佛為世諦如是說，<caesura/>世諦諸法不全無，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b17\">0370b17</span><p class=\"lg\">如世諦法體性住，<caesura/>如是知已為眾說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b18\">0370b18</span><p class=\"lg\">世尊如是說諸法，<caesura/>大悲所作甚奇特，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b19\">0370b19</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法體性不可見，<caesura/>如來方便說其<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370001\">性＝住【宋】【明】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370001\">性【大】，住【宋】【明】</span><app n=\"0370001\"><p class=\"lg\">性</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【明】\">住</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b20\">0370b20</span><p class=\"lg\">我等願作無邊稱，<caesura/>具百福相大導師，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b21\">0370b21</span><p class=\"lg\">大悲利益諸世間，<caesura/>願作世親如今佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b22\">0370b22</span><p class=\"lg\">我等願於闇障者，<caesura/>隨順貪<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370002\">駃＝駚【三】【宮】【聖】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370002\">駛【CB】【磧乙-CB】，駃【大】，駚【宋】【元】【明】【宮】【聖】</span><app n=\"0370002\"><p class=\"lg\">駛<note type=\"cf1\">QC015n0023_p0496a02</note></lem><rdg wit=\"【大】\">駃</rdg><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【宋】 【元】 【明】 【宮】 【聖】\">駚</rdg></app>欲流者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b23\">0370b23</span><p class=\"lg\">渴愛所纏百苦者，<caesura/>救濟度脫如世尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b24\">0370b24</span><p class=\"lg\">我等願於眾苦者，<caesura/>不見彼岸魔縛者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b25\">0370b25</span><p class=\"lg\">走如猨猴輕躁者，<caesura/>救濟度脫如世尊。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b26\">0370b26</span><p class=\"lg\">我等願於盲冥者，<caesura/>六趣往來疲勞者，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b27\">0370b27</span><p class=\"lg\">於己自壞業果者，<caesura/>救濟度脫如世尊。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b28\">0370b28</span><p>爾時世尊知彼三億六千萬乾闥婆眾深生信\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370b29\">0370b29</span>已，現微笑相。爾時慧命馬勝比丘以偈問\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c01\">0370c01</span>曰：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c02\">0370c02</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「無邊威德現微笑，<caesura/>導師<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370003\">如是＝知見【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370003\">如是【大】，知見【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0370003\"><p class=\"lg\">如是</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">知見</rdg></app>非無因。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c03\">0370c03</span><p class=\"lg\">願佛速說此因緣，<caesura/>斷除眾生諸疑網。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c04\">0370c04</span><p class=\"lg\">今見世尊微笑已，<caesura/>大眾皆悉為疑網，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c05\">0370c05</span><p class=\"lg\">一切願聞微笑義，<caesura/>唯願大悲斷眾疑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c06\">0370c06</span><p class=\"lg\">誰於佛法生敬信？<caesura/>能得離於諸疑網？</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c07\">0370c07</span><p class=\"lg\">佛知眾生深信已，<caesura/>人天勝者故現笑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c08\">0370c08</span><p class=\"lg\">誰有智慧能隨順，<caesura/>如來所說真如法，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c09\">0370c09</span><p class=\"lg\">知其念慧解行已？<caesura/>在大眾中現微笑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c10\">0370c10</span><p class=\"lg\">一切大眾無異心，<caesura/>唯欲樂聞雄猛說，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c11\">0370c11</span><p class=\"lg\">合十指掌在首頂，<caesura/>一心瞻仰如來面。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c12\">0370c12</span><p class=\"lg\">離諸穢濁無憂慮，<caesura/>世眼現在故欣喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c13\">0370c13</span><p class=\"lg\">為除一切心疑惑，<caesura/>願大悲說笑因緣。」</p></lg>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c14\">0370c14</span><p>爾時世尊以偈答慧命馬勝言：</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c15\">0370c15</span><p class=\"lg\"><p class=\"lg\">「我所現笑為世故，<caesura/>善哉汝問正是時，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c16\">0370c16</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾善根當增長，<caesura/>為我微笑授記<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370004\">事＝故【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370004\">事【大】，故【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0370004\"><p class=\"lg\">事</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖乙】\">故</rdg></app>。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c17\">0370c17</span><p class=\"lg\">馬勝諦聽我所說，<caesura/>導師所現此微笑，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c18\">0370c18</span><p class=\"lg\">我今當正說彼義，<caesura/>汝應欣喜聽我說。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c19\">0370c19</span><p class=\"lg\">乾闥婆王敬信佛，<caesura/>其心清淨生欣喜，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c20\">0370c20</span><p class=\"lg\">依於實法入法已，<caesura/>於佛正法生希奇。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c21\">0370c21</span><p class=\"lg\">諸法寂滅安不動，<caesura/>此等大眾趣實際，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c22\">0370c22</span><p class=\"lg\">如乾闥城如是入，<caesura/>供養於我無有等。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c23\">0370c23</span><p class=\"lg\">如是諸法無有生，<caesura/>一切亦復不盡滅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c24\">0370c24</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾思惟如幻住，<caesura/>未能解了生疑惑。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c25\">0370c25</span><p class=\"lg\">不可說法方便說，<caesura/>我以<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370005\">真＝其【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0370005\">真【大】，其【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0370005\"><p class=\"lg\">真</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖乙】\">其</rdg></app>實故如是，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c26\">0370c26</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等入我正法已，<caesura/>乘大龍象供養佛。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c27\">0370c27</span><p class=\"lg\">觀察菩提無生滅，<caesura/>乾闥婆王供養我，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c28\">0370c28</span><p class=\"lg\">悲愍愚迷眾生等，<caesura/>是故求大一切智。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0370c29\">0370c29</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等發願當作佛，<caesura/>令諸愚迷失智者，</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a01\">0371a01</span><p class=\"lg\">入真實法安住已，<caesura/>使得不死寂滅句。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a02\">0371a02</span><p class=\"lg\">此等作是供養已，<caesura/>捨離鬼身心喜悅，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a03\">0371a03</span><p class=\"lg\">定得往生天宮中，<caesura/>恒與帝釋相親近。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a04\">0371a04</span><p class=\"lg\">得值多億那由<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371001\">他＝佛【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371001\">他【大】，佛【聖】【聖乙】</span><app n=\"0371001\"><p class=\"lg\">他</lem><rdg resp=\"Taisho\" wit=\"【聖】 【聖乙】\">佛</rdg></app>，<caesura/>供養無垢諸善逝，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a05\">0371a05</span><p class=\"lg\">從一佛剎至一剎，<caesura/>於諸佛所得聞法。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a06\">0371a06</span><p class=\"lg\">彼等修淨佛行已，<caesura/>所得佛土亦清淨，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a07\">0371a07</span><p class=\"lg\">化無量眾發道心，<caesura/>令其增長佛種子。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a08\">0371a08</span><p class=\"lg\">知諸世間性空已，<caesura/>亦以此法教導他，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a09\">0371a09</span><p class=\"lg\">令眾安住一切智，<caesura/>住世無量那由劫。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a10\">0371a10</span><p class=\"lg\">彼佛同號無邊慧，<caesura/>一一諸佛住於世，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a11\">0371a11</span><p class=\"lg\">皆悉無量那由劫，<caesura/>演說佛道令他聞。」</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a12\">0371a12</span><p class=\"lg\">如是釋迦牟尼佛，<caesura/>說乾闥婆供養報，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a13\">0371a13</span><p class=\"lg\">與其授記令得聞，<caesura/>馬勝所問笑因緣。</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a14\">0371a14</span><p class=\"lg\">大眾聞已皆欣喜，<caesura/>知彼佛記甚可樂，</p>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a15\">0371a15</span><p class=\"lg\">聞是無等佛記已，<caesura/>皆悉歸依釋迦文。<span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371002\">不分卷【聖】【聖乙】</span><span class=\"note-text\" id=\"note_0371002\">不分卷【聖】【聖乙】</span></p></lg><anchor type=\"circle\"/>\r\n<span class=\"lb\" id=\"p0371a16\">0371a16</span><cb:juan n=\"064\" fun=\"close\"><cb:jhead><title>大寶積經</title>卷第六十四</cb:jhead></cb:juan></cb:div>\r\n</cb:div></body>"
    }
  ],
  "version": "CBReader 2X v0.9.9 2026-01-21"
}